{"id":"15272277","articleId":"13369877","title":"How to Sign-Up","description":"How to create a Polymarket account.","blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"There are three ways to sign up for Polymarket.","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" ","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"subheading","text":"<b>Sign Up With Google</b>","idAttribute":"h_b0c7f20fcc"},{"type":"orderedNestedList","text":"1. Click <b>Sign Up</b>.\n2. Select <b>Continue with Google</b>.\n3. Connect your Google account.\n4. Complete the signup process.","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Click <b>Sign Up</b>.","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Select <b>Continue with Google</b>.","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Connect your Google account.","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Complete the signup process.","class":"no-margin"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","text":"You can now log in using your <b>Google account</b>.","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" ","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"subheading","text":"<b>Sign Up with Email</b>","idAttribute":"h_03e957b4ca"},{"type":"orderedNestedList","text":"1. Click <b>Sign Up</b>.\n2. Enter your <b>email address</b> and click <b>Continue</b>.\n3. Enter the <b>6-digit code</b> sent to your email.\n4. You're signed up.","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Click <b>Sign Up</b>.","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Enter your <b>email address</b> and click <b>Continue</b>.","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Enter the <b>6-digit code</b> sent to your email.","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"You're signed up.","class":"no-margin"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","text":"You can now log in using your <b>email and 6-digit code</b>.","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" ","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"callout","content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"<b>Never share your 6-digit login code </b>- not even with Polymarket staff. If someone gains access to your code, they can access your account and funds. <b>Polymarket support cannot recover lost funds</b> caused by shared codes.","class":"no-margin"}],"style":{"backgroundColor":"#e3e7fa80","borderColor":"#334bfa33"}},{"type":"paragraph","text":" ","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"subheading","text":"<b>Sign Up with Crypto Wallet</b>","idAttribute":"h_69381cd54a"},{"type":"orderedNestedList","text":"1. Click <b>Sign Up</b>.\n2. Connect your <b>crypto wallet</b> (such as MetaMask, Rabby, or Phantom).\n3. Sign a message to <b>Connect your wallet</b> to Polymarket.\n4. Sign another message to <b>Enable Trading</b>.\n5. You're signed up.","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Click <b>Sign Up</b>.","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Connect your <b>crypto wallet</b> (such as MetaMask, Rabby, or Phantom).","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Sign a message to <b>Connect your wallet</b> to Polymarket.","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Sign another message to <b>Enable Trading</b>.","class":"no-margin"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"You're signed up.","class":"no-margin"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","text":"You can now log in using your <b>connected wallet</b>.","class":"no-margin"}],"markdown":null,"author":null,"collectionId":"17859237","targetUserType":"everyone","lastUpdated":"Updated over 7 months ago","lastUpdatedDate":"2026-01-12T17:42:42Z","showTableOfContents":true,"synced":false,"relatedArticles":[{"title":"Recover Missing Deposit","url":"https://help.polymarket.com/en/articles/13364241-recover-missing-deposit"},{"title":"How Do I Export My Key?","url":"https://help.polymarket.com/en/articles/13364258-how-do-i-export-my-key"},{"title":"Is My Money Safe?","url":"https://help.polymarket.com/en/articles/13364260-is-my-money-safe"},{"title":"How to Deposit","url":"https://help.polymarket.com/en/articles/13369887-how-to-deposit"},{"title":"Referral Program","url":"https://help.polymarket.com/en/articles/14174498-referral-program"}],"locale":"en","breadcrumbs":[{"url":"https://help.polymarket.com/en/collections/17859237-getting-started","name":"Getting Started"}],"canonicalUrl":"https://help.polymarket.com/en/articles/13369877-how-to-sign-up","selectedReaction":null,"showReactions":true}